> *"The most useful day was the last one. I built a streak feature test-first, and it forced me to answer design questions before writing any code. The clearest example: a function that calls new Date internally can't be tested, because the result changes depending on when you run it. Writing the test first pushed me to pass the date in as an argument — which made the function pure almost by accident."*
